cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "openEO2Mintpy"
abstract: >-
  openEO2Mintpy prepares geocoded Sentinel-1 interferograms from the Copernicus
  Data Space Ecosystem (CDSE) openEO service for MintPy small-baseline time-series
  analysis. It reconstructs the per-date perpendicular baselines and the per-pixel
  viewing geometry from the product names, the public CDSE burst catalogue, the
  Sentinel-1 precise orbits and a digital elevation model.
type: software
